              "question": "Find non-singular matrices \\(P\\) and \\(Q\\) such that \\(PAQ\\) is in normal form. Hence find the rank of \\(A\\), where (i) \\(A=\\begin{bmatrix}2&3&1&4\\\\1&2&2&3\\\\0&-1&-3&-2\\end{bmatrix}\\); (ii) \\(A=\\begin{bmatrix}3&2&-1&5\\\\5&1&4&-2\\\\1&-4&11&-19\\end{bmatrix}\\); (iii) \\(A=\\begin{bmatrix}0&1&2&-2\\\\4&0&2&6\\\\2&1&3&1\\end{bmatrix}\\); (iv) \\(A=\\begin{bmatrix}1&2&-1&3\\\\3&4&0&-1\\\\-1&0&-2&7\\end{bmatrix}\\).",
