                "paragraphs": [
                  "For each matrix, row transformations are tracked on \\(I_3\\) to form \\(P\\), and column transformations are tracked on \\(I_4\\) to form \\(Q\\). The resulting normal form is \\(PAQ\\).",
                  "(i) Start with",
                  "\\[A=\\left[\\begin{matrix}2 & 3 & 1 & 4\\\\1 & 2 & 2 & 3\\\\0 & -1 & -3 & -2\\end{matrix}\\right]\\]",
                  "Apply \\(C_{1}\\leftrightarrow C_{3}\\):",
                  "\\[\\left[\\begin{matrix}1 & 3 & 2 & 4\\\\2 & 2 & 1 & 3\\\\-3 & -1 & 0 & -2\\end{matrix}\\right]\\]",
                  "Then apply \\(R_{2}\\to R_{2}-2R_{1}\\):",
                  "\\[\\left[\\begin{matrix}1 & 3 & 2 & 4\\\\0 & -4 & -3 & -5\\\\-3 & -1 & 0 & -2\\end{matrix}\\right]\\]",
                  "Then apply \\(R_{3}\\to R_{3}+3R_{1}\\):",
                  "\\[\\left[\\begin{matrix}1 & 3 & 2 & 4\\\\0 & -4 & -3 & -5\\\\0 & 8 & 6 & 10\\end{matrix}\\right]\\]",
                  "Then apply \\(C_{2}\\to C_{2}-3C_{1}\\):",
                  "\\[\\left[\\begin{matrix}1 & 0 & 2 & 4\\\\0 & -4 & -3 & -5\\\\0 & 8 & 6 & 10\\end{matrix}\\right]\\]",
                  "Then apply \\(C_{3}\\to C_{3}-2C_{1}\\):",
